.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# local-only sites config (real device hosts never in the public repo; P2 decision 2026-10-19)
sites.toml
!examples/sites.toml
# operator-created deploy files. deploy/compose.yaml tells the operator to create these by
# copying the tracked templates beside them and to keep the filled-in copies mode 0600 and
# "out of git": gateclerk.env carries the site tokens, mnotify.toml the notify config. Named
# as exact paths rather than `*.env` so this rule can never shadow a tracked template or a
# future fixture; tests/test_deploy_templates.py pins both directions.
deploy/gateclerk.env
deploy/mnotify.toml
